# .gitignore: files git should never add, commit or push.
# Anything listed here stays on your computer only, so it's never
# published on GitHub Pages. (One pattern per line; # starts a comment.)

# Planning notes for building the site (not part of the website)
SPEC.md
courses.md
recipes.md
study-files.md

# Zip files (photo downloads etc.)
*.zip

# Photo download folders inside images/
images/vsco_photos/
images/daisyicon_pins*/

# Photos the site doesn't use: anything still called photo_XX.jpg.
# (* means "anything here".) To use one, rename it to the name the page
# expects, e.g. cats-4.jpg, and it's no longer ignored.
images/photo_*.jpg
